# Test: H2O RMP2/6-31G OPT + FREQ pathway (v0.65.0)
#
# Starts from a slightly distorted geometry; the optimizer should
# drive it back to the MP2/6-31G minimum, after which the analytical
# RMP2 Hessian is built and frequencies printed.  Reference values
# (at the optimized minimum) are the same as test_mp2_h2o_freq.inp:
#   bend            1662.56 cm^-1
#   sym stretch     3657.90 cm^-1
#   asym stretch    3834.22 cm^-1
#
%method  MP2
%basis   6-31G
%frozen_core 0
%job     optfreq
%charge  0
%mult    1
%geom_maxiter 15
%print_time

*geometry angstrom
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.100000
H   0.000000   0.780000  -0.450000
H   0.000000  -0.780000  -0.450000
*end
